      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ class AIagent:\n\n                            Defines a custom class named AIagent\n                    Represents an AI agent object\n\nWill hold:\nLLM client\n        conversation history\n\n            tools the agent can use",
      "fontSize": 22.59026140566484,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1️⃣ class AIagent:\n\n                            Defines a custom class named AIagent\n                    Represents an AI agent object\n\nWill hold:\nLLM client\n        conversation history\n\n            tools the agent can use",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q3oMaR7lmF68Rna9PuQ13",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3525.018693560641,
      "y": 1598.275580088297,
      "width": 829.0931396484375,
      "height": 141.18913378540526,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1728821677,
      "version": 416,
      "versionNonce": 516997805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769766689207,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2️⃣ def __init__(self, api_key: str):\n\n__init__ is the constructor\n                    Runs automatically when you create an object\n                            api_key: str → type hint (expects a string API key)",
      "fontSize": 22.59026140566484,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2️⃣ def __init__(self, api_key: str):\n\n__init__ is the constructor\n                    Runs automatically when you create an object\n                            api_key: str → type hint (expects a string API key)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QVFOcBfAPgSsTnsBpSsMV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3756.7599350157197,
      "y": 1785.6089541117342,
      "width": 475.61065673828125,
      "height": 197.66478729956737,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1276556067,
      "version": 514,
      "versionNonce": 570216835,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769766575273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3️⃣ self.client = Anthropic(api_key=api_key)\nCreates an Anthropic client\nStores it inside the agent\nThis client is used to:\nSend messages to Claude\nReceive responses\nself.client = the agent’s LLM interface",
      "fontSize": 22.59026140566484,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3️⃣ self.client = Anthropic(api_key=api_key)\nCreates an Anthropic client\nStores it inside the agent\nThis client is used to:\nSend messages to Claude\nReceive responses\nself.client = the agent’s LLM interface",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wR7m2G_k8FfjrXO5DYEdt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4417.000795001073,
      "y": 1272.275404612223,
      "width": 454.45562744140625,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 101062755,
      "version": 114,
      "versionNonce": 1853720973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769766734235,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4️⃣ self.messages: List[Dict[str, Any]] = []\n\nInitializes an empty conversation history\nEach item will typically look like:\n\n{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}\nType hint meaning:\nList → multiple messages\nDict → each message is a key–value pair\nAny → content can vary (text, tool calls, etc.)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4️⃣ self.messages: List[Dict[str, Any]] = []\n\nInitializes an empty conversation history\nEach item will typically look like:\n\n{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}\nType hint meaning:\nList → multiple messages\nDict → each message is a key–value pair\nAny → content can vary (text, tool calls, etc.)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-0b9FvJVMy-tx94LtwZsh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4101.855226153417,
      "y": 1592.2753156026201,
      "width": 954.0796508789062,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517826403,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 583715523,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769766771527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5️⃣ self.tools: List[Tool] = []\n\nInitializes an empty list of tools\nEach tool is a Tool (Pydantic model)\n                                    Tools define what the agent can do (weather, search, file ops, etc.)\n\n                    This enables tool calling / function calling",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5️⃣ self.tools: List[Tool] = []\n\nInitializes an empty list of tools\nEach tool is a Tool (Pydantic model)\n                                    Tools define what the agent can do (weather, search, file ops, etc.)\n\n                    This enables tool calling / function calling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
